{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.qbeta_energy_scale","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.qbeta_energy_scale","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Units","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Invertible.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.Qbeta_closed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.Qbeta_closed","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/qbeta_energy_scale.lean#L85-L105","doc":"**Q_β closed form.** The β-decay Q-value as *(net reduction content)*\n`×` *(per-Hecke-step energy)*:\n`Q_β = ε(Δ) · 𝔈₀ = m_e (q+1)(q²−2q−1) / (2q³)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:qbeta-counit-closed-form","label":"prop:qbeta-counit-closed-form","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/qbeta-counit-closed-form.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.epsNPq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.epsNPq","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/qbeta_energy_scale.lean#L79-L83","doc":"Frobenius counit of the `N=0` neutron−proton NF difference, in `q`\n(via `h = q − q⁻¹`): `ε(Δ) = (q²−1)(q²−2q−1) / (2q²)`. Matches\n`QBetaCounitTrace.epsNP_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.E0_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.E0_eq","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/qbeta_energy_scale.lean#L66-L75","doc":"**`𝔈₀` factorisation.** The per-Hecke-step energy collapses to\n`m_e / (q(q−1))` — here in its division-free form `m_e · q⁻¹ · d⁻¹`,\nthe form derived from CAL-1 (`m_e`) + CAL-2 (`q₀`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.E0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.E0","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/qbeta_energy_scale.lean#L62-L64","doc":"Energy of one Hecke reduction step `σ² → hσ + 𝟙`, in units of `m_e`:\n`𝔈₀ = m_e · c_q² · ℏ_q^E`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.hbarE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.hbarE","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/qbeta_energy_scale.lean#L58-L60","doc":"Action per Planck tick (energy-scale convention), `ℏ_q^E = (q−1)/q`.\nDistinct from the Hecke parameter `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.cqSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.QBetaEnergyScale.cqSq","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/qbeta_energy_scale.lean#L54-L56","doc":"Information speed squared in `q`-Planck units, `c_q² = 1/(q−1)²`, with\nthe temporal weight `q − 1` carried as the unit `d : Rˣ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}